Package: osscontribs
Title: Open Source Project Contributor Growth Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christos", "Longros", , "chris.longros@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Aggregated monthly contributor statistics for major open
    source projects. Contains no personal data -- only monthly counts
    and cumulative totals. Projects include FreeBSD, OpenBSD, NetBSD,
    Linux, PostgreSQL, and others.
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
